<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>{{ organization.name }} — Rapport d'audit IA & Performance</title>
<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 18mm 16mm 18mm 16mm;
    @bottom-left { content: "{{ (organization.name ~ " — " ~ mission.name)|css_string }}"; font-family: Inter, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; color: #6b7280; }
    @bottom-right { content: "Page " counter(page) " / " counter(pages); font-family: Inter, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; color: #6b7280; }
    {% if not mission.published %}@top-right { content: "VERSION DE TRAVAIL — NON PUBLIÉE"; font-family: Inter, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; color: #b45309; font-weight: 700; }{% endif %}
  }
  @page :first { @bottom-left { content: ""; } @bottom-right { content: ""; } }
  :root { --ink: #18212f; --muted: #6b7280; --line: #e5e7eb; --info: #2563eb; --value: #15803d; --check: #b45309; --risk: #b91c1c; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { font-family: Inter, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif; color: var(--ink); font-size: 9.5pt; line-height: 1.45; margin: 0; background: #fff; }
  .page { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px; }
  h1 { font-size: 24pt; margin: 0 0 4px; }
  h2 { font-size: 15pt; margin: 28px 0 10px; padding-bottom: 6px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink); break-after: avoid; }
  h3 { font-size: 11pt; margin: 16px 0 6px; break-after: avoid; }
  p { margin: 4px 0 8px; }
  .muted { color: var(--muted); }
  .eyebrow { font-size: 8pt; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; font-weight: 700; color: var(--muted); }
  .cover { min-height: 230mm; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; break-after: page; }
  .cover .brand { font-weight: 800; font-size: 14pt; } .cover .brand span { color: var(--info); }
  .cover h1 { font-size: 30pt; margin-top: 60mm; }
  .draft { display: inline-block; margin-top: 10px; padding: 4px 10px; border: 1.5px solid var(--check); color: var(--check); border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 9pt; }
  .figures { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 8px; margin: 12px 0; }
  .figure { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; }
  .figure b { display: block; font-size: 15pt; } .figure.value b { color: var(--value); }
  .callout { border-left: 3px solid var(--info); background: #f8fafc; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 6px; margin: 8px 0; break-inside: avoid; }
  .callout.decision { border-color: var(--value); }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 6px 0 10px; font-size: 8.5pt; }
  th { text-align: left; font-size: 7.5pt; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; color: var(--muted); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 4px 6px; }
  td { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 4px 6px; vertical-align: top; }
  tr { break-inside: avoid; }
  .num { text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; }
  .tag { display: inline-block; font-size: 7pt; font-weight: 700; padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 999px; background: #f3f4f6; color: #374151; white-space: nowrap; }
  .tag.critique, .tag.elevee { background: #fee2e2; color: var(--risk); }
  .tag.moyenne { background: #ffedd5; color: var(--check); }
  .tag.fait { background: #dbeafe; color: var(--info); } .tag.calcul { background: #dcfce7; color: var(--value); } .tag.hypothese { background: #ffedd5; color: var(--check); }
  .tag.a_verifier { background: #ffedd5; color: var(--check); } .tag.valide { background: #dcfce7; color: var(--value); } .tag.corrige { background: #dbeafe; color: var(--info); }
  .tag.P1 { background: #dcfce7; color: var(--value); } .tag.P2 { background: #dbeafe; color: var(--info); }
  .finding, .case { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 12px; margin: 8px 0; break-inside: avoid; }
  .case { break-inside: auto; }
  .case-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; align-items: baseline; }
  .kpis { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 6px; margin: 8px 0; }
  .kpis div { background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 6px; padding: 5px 8px; } .kpis b { display: block; font-size: 10.5pt; }
  .ref { display: inline-block; margin-left: 3px; font-size: 6.5pt; font-weight: 700; color: var(--info); text-decoration: none; vertical-align: super; }
  .phase { border-top: 3px solid #93c5fd; padding-top: 4px; margin-top: 10px; break-inside: avoid; }
  .bar { height: 6px; background: #e5e7eb; border-radius: 999px; overflow: hidden; } .bar i { display: block; height: 100%; background: var(--info); }
  .legend { font-size: 8pt; color: var(--muted); }
  .annex td { font-size: 7.5pt; } .annex tr.group td { background: #f8fafc; padding-top: 6px; } .excerpt { font-family: Menlo, monospace; font-size: 7pt; color: #4b5563; white-space: pre-wrap; }
  .recs { padding-left: 18px; margin: 4px 0 10px; } .recs li { margin-bottom: 5px; break-inside: avoid; }
  .break { break-before: page; }
  @media screen { body { background: #f5f7fb; } .page { background: #fff; margin: 16px auto; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.08); border-radius: 12px; } .cover { min-height: auto; } .cover h1 { margin-top: 30px; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

<section class="cover">
  <div class="brand">Audit<span>Flow</span></div>
  <div>
    <div class="eyebrow">Audit IA & Performance — rapport dirigeant</div>
    <h1>{{ organization.name }}</h1>
    <p class="muted">{{ organization.sector }}{% if organization.city %} — {{ organization.city }}{% endif %}{% if organization.employees %} — {{ organization.employees }} collaborateurs{% endif %}</p>
    {% if mission.published %}<p><b>Publié le {{ mission.published_at }}</b> · analyse v{{ mission.version }}</p>
    {% else %}<span class="draft">Version de travail — non publiée</span>{% endif %}
  </div>
  <div class="legend">
    Généré le {{ generated_at }} · {{ figures.sources }} sources analysées · analyse v{{ mission.version }}{% if mission.analyzed_at %} du {{ mission.analyzed_at }}{% endif %}<br>
    Document confidentiel. Chaque chiffre est relié à sa source (annexe A, références <span class="ref">E#</span>) et qualifié :
    <span class="tag fait">Fait</span> lu dans une source, <span class="tag calcul">Calcul</span> déterministe, <span class="tag hypothese">Hypothèse</span> à valider.
  </div>
</section>

<h2>1. Synthèse exécutive</h2>
<div class="figures">
  <div class="figure value"><span class="eyebrow">Potentiel brut annuel</span><b>{{ figures.value }}</b><span class="muted">{{ figures.opportunities }} opportunités</span></div>
  <div class="figure value"><span class="eyebrow">Opportunités prioritaires</span><b>{{ figures.value_p1 }}</b><span class="muted">{{ figures.p1 }} en P1</span></div>
  <div class="figure"><span class="eyebrow">Irritants</span><b>{{ figures.pain_points }}</b><span class="muted">dont {{ figures.critical }} critiques</span></div>
  <div class="figure"><span class="eyebrow">Revue consultant</span><b>{{ figures.reviewed }}</b><span class="muted">confiance analyse {{ figures.confidence }}</span></div>
</div>
{% for r in recommendations %}
  {% if r.key == "summary" %}<p>{{ r.text }}</p>
  {% elif r.key == "decision" %}<div class="callout decision"><b>{{ r.title }} :</b> {{ r.text }}</div>
  {% elif r.key == "hypotheses" %}<div class="callout"><b>{{ r.title }} :</b> {{ r.text }}</div>{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% set priorities = recommendations | rejectattr("key", "in", ["summary", "decision", "hypotheses"]) | list %}
{% if priorities %}
<h3>Recommandations prioritaires</h3>
<ol class="recs">{% for r in priorities %}<li><b>{{ r.title }}</b> — {{ r.text }}</li>{% endfor %}</ol>
{% endif %}

<h3>Opportunités prioritaires</h3>
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Opportunité</th><th>Catégorie</th><th class="num">Valeur / an</th><th class="num">Payback</th><th>Effort</th><th>Priorité</th><th>Statut</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for c in cases[:8] %}
    <tr><td>{{ c.rank or "—" }}</td><td><b>{{ c.title }}</b></td><td>{{ c.category }}</td><td class="num">{{ c.value }}</td><td class="num">{{ c.payback }}</td><td>{{ c.effort }}</td><td><span class="tag {{ c.priority }}">{{ c.priority }}</span></td><td><span class="tag {{ c.status_key }}">{{ c.status }}</span></td></tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

{% if maturity %}
<h3>Maturité opérationnelle</h3>
<table>
  {% for m in maturity %}
  <tr><td style="width:28%"><b>{{ m.label }}</b></td><td style="width:22%"><div class="bar"><i style="width: {{ (m.value * 100)|round(0) }}%"></i></div></td><td class="num" style="width:8%">{{ (m.value * 100)|round(0)|int }} %</td><td class="muted">{{ m.explanation }}</td></tr>
  {% endfor %}
</table>
{% endif %}

<h2 class="break">2. Constats</h2>
<p class="muted">Irritants classés par criticité. Les points marqués « hypothèse à valider » ne reposent sur aucune donnée directe.</p>
{% for f in findings %}
<div class="finding">
  <div class="case-head"><b>{{ f.title }}</b>{{ f.refs|refs }}<span><span class="tag {{ f.crit_key }}">{{ f.criticality }}</span> <span class="tag {{ f.status_key }}">{{ f.status }}</span>{% if f.hypothesis %} <span class="tag hypothese">Hypothèse à valider</span>{% endif %}</span></div>
  <div class="muted" style="font-size:8pt">{{ f.department }} · confiance {{ f.confidence }}</div>
  <p>{{ f.description }}</p>
  {% if f.metrics %}
  <table>
    {% for m in f.metrics %}<tr><td>{{ m.label }}{{ m.refs|refs }}<div class="muted" style="font-size:7pt">{{ m.formula }}</div></td><td class="num"><b>{{ m.value }}</b></td><td style="width:70px"><span class="tag {{ m.nature_key }}">{{ m.nature }}</span></td></tr>{% endfor %}
  </table>
  {% endif %}
</div>
{% endfor %}

<h2 class="break">3. Business cases</h2>
{% for c in cases %}
<div class="case">
  <div class="case-head"><h3 style="margin:0">{{ c.title }}</h3><span><span class="tag {{ c.priority }}">{{ c.priority }}</span> <span class="tag {{ c.status_key }}">{{ c.status }}</span></span></div>
  <p>{{ c.summary }}</p>
  <p class="muted" style="font-size:8pt"><b>{{ c.category }}</b> — {{ c.rationale }}</p>
  <div class="kpis">
    <div>Valeur brute<b>{{ c.value }}/an</b></div><div>Gain net<b>{{ c.net }}/an</b></div><div>Payback<b>{{ c.payback }}</b></div><div>ROI 12 / 36 mois<b>{{ c.roi12 }} / {{ c.roi36 }}</b></div>
  </div>
  {% if c.lines %}<table><thead><tr><th>Source de valeur</th><th class="num">Valeur / an</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for l in c.lines %}<tr><td>{{ l.label }}</td><td class="num">{{ l.value }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}<tr><td class="muted">Coût projet {{ c.project_cost }} · coût récurrent {{ c.run_cost }}/an · {{ c.hours }} h/mois économisées</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>{% endif %}
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Hypothèse</th><th class="num">Valeur</th><th>Nature</th><th>Source / justification</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>{% for a in c.assumptions %}<tr><td>{{ a.label }}{{ a.refs|refs }}{% if a.edited %} <span class="tag corrige">ajustée</span>{% endif %}</td><td class="num">{{ a.value }}</td><td><span class="tag {{ a.nature_key }}">{{ a.nature }}</span></td><td class="muted">{{ a.source }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody>
  </table>
  {% if c.pilot %}<p style="font-size:8pt"><b>Plan pilote :</b> {% for p in c.pilot %}{{ p.step }} ({{ p.weeks }} sem.){% if not loop.last %} → {% endif %}{% endfor %}</p>{% endif %}
</div>
{% endfor %}

<h2 class="break">4. Roadmap</h2>
{% for p in roadmap %}
<div class="phase">
  <h3>{{ p.label }}</h3>
  <table><tbody>{% for i in p["items"] %}<tr><td><b>{{ i.title }}</b></td><td style="width:90px"><span class="tag">{{ i.kind }}</span></td><td style="width:80px">{{ i.weeks }}</td><td style="width:120px" class="muted">{{ i.owner }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table>
</div>
{% endfor %}

{% if risks %}
<h2>5. Risques</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Risque</th><th>Gravité</th><th class="num">Exposition</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>{% for r in risks %}<tr><td><b>{{ r.title }}</b><div class="muted">{{ r.description }}</div></td><td><span class="tag">{{ r.severity }}</span></td><td class="num">{{ r.exposure }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table>
{% endif %}

<h2 class="break">Annexe A — Preuves citées</h2>
<table class="annex">
  <thead><tr><th>Réf.</th><th>Source</th><th>Localisation</th><th>Constat / extrait</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>{% for e in evidence %}<tr id="E{{ e.n }}"><td><b>E{{ e.n }}</b></td><td>{{ e.file }}</td><td>{{ e.where }}</td><td>{{ e.summary }}{% if e.origin == "user" %} <span class="tag corrige">ajoutée par le consultant</span>{% endif %}{% if e.excerpt %}<div class="excerpt">{{ e.excerpt }}</div>{% endif %}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody>
</table>

<h2>Annexe B — Hypothèses à valider</h2>
<table class="annex">
  <thead><tr><th>Hypothèse</th><th class="num">Valeur</th><th>Justification</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>{% for h in hypotheses %}<tr class="group"><td colspan="3"><b>{{ h.case }}</b></td></tr>{% for a in h["items"] %}<tr><td>{{ a.label }}{% if a.edited %} <span class="tag corrige">ajustée</span>{% endif %}</td><td class="num">{{ a.value }}</td><td class="muted">{{ a.source }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}{% endfor %}</tbody>
</table>

<h2>Annexe C — Méthode</h2>
<p><b>Détection :</b> détecteurs déterministes appliqués aux concepts des données (montants, retards, ressaisies, SLA…), indépendamment des noms de fichiers ; chaque constat cite les lignes ou extraits utilisés. Aucun chiffre n'est produit par un modèle de langage.</p>
<p><b>Priorisation :</b> Priorité = {% for k, w in weights.items() if w > 0 %}{{ "%.2f"|format(w) }} × {{ k }}{% if not loop.last %} + {% endif %}{% endfor %}{% for k, w in penalties.items() if w > 0 %} − {{ "%.2f"|format(w) }} × {{ k }}{% endfor %}{% if not default_weights %} (coefficients personnalisés){% endif %}. Les étiquettes P1/P2/P3 sont attribuées par rang au sein de la mission.</p>
<p><b>Chiffrage :</b> moteur ROI déterministe : heures/mois = Π facteurs ; valeur annuelle = heures × coût horaire × 12 ou Π facteurs ; payback = coût projet / (gain net / 12) ; ROI 12 mois = (gain net − coût projet) / coût projet ; ROI 36 mois = (3 × gain net − coût projet) / coût projet.</p>
{% if completeness.gaps %}<p><b>Limites des données :</b> {{ completeness.gaps|join(" ; ") }}.</p>{% endif %}

<h2>Annexe D — Sources analysées ({{ sources|length }})</h2>
<table class="annex"><thead><tr><th>Fichier</th><th>Catégorie</th><th>Empreinte</th><th>Statut</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>{% for s in sources %}<tr><td>{{ s.path }}</td><td>{{ s.category }}</td><td>{{ s.sha }}</td><td>{{ s.status }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table>

{% if validations %}
<h2>Annexe E — Journal de validation</h2>
<table class="annex"><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Consultant</th><th>Élément</th><th>Décision</th><th>Champs modifiés</th><th>Commentaire</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>{% for v in validations %}<tr><td>{{ v.when }}</td><td>{{ v.who }}</td><td>{{ v.what }}</td><td>{{ v.status }}</td><td>{{ v.fields }}</td><td>{{ v.comment }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table>
{% endif %}

</div>
</body>
</html>
